REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Download the current schema from the authority's portal by hand.
  2. Compare md5 and size with the line here. Never judge a download by its
     size alone — a portal error page is a plausible size too.
  3. If it differs, the authority revised the schema: review the diff, update
     the bundled file and this line, and re-run the module's tests. A new
     vintage is a new cssk.payroll.declaration.version record with its own
     template.
  4. Record the URL you used here, so the next refresh can be done by curl.
